6. BACKEND DEEP DIVE
--------------------
Layered path:
HTTP request -> Controller -> Service -> Repository/MongoTemplate -> MongoDB.

Major modules:
- auth: login, logout, current session
- owner: owner account, profile, password, verification
- pg: owner PG CRUD and images
- student: approved public listing/details/search
- search: full-text search
- admin: PG and owner verification moderation
- notification: owner notifications
- app: CAPTCHA, contact, issue reports
- security: JWT, user details, filters, authorization
- infrastructure: Mongo, cache, Cloudinary, email

GlobalExceptionHandler centralizes exception responses. RequestLoggingFilter logs request activity and correlation IDs. SecurityConfig enables stateless security, CORS, method security, BCrypt, and route authorization.

