25. TROUBLESHOOTING
-------------------
Frontend start/build failure: check Node version, dependencies, frontend env, and API URL.
Backend start failure: check Java/Maven, MONGO_URI, JWT variables, Cloudinary variables, and mail variables.
Mongo failure: check credentials, Atlas network access, and URI.
CORS failure: check CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS and browser origin.
Login failure: check email verification, active state, password, lockout, and cookie settings.
PG not public: check owner verification and PG approval status.
Contact missing: check PG ownerId and matching owner document.
Image failure: check MIME/size, Cloudinary variables, and remote image config.
Email failure: check SMTP/Brevo variables and provider logs.
CAPTCHA failure: check token expiry, answer, IP, and one-time use.
Sitemap issue: check public/robots.txt, next-sitemap.config.js, canonical host, and deployment.

